        "content": "The file /home/runner/work/agentdaily/agentdaily/updates/2026-08-12/whitelist-updates.json has been updated. Here's the result of running `cat -n` on a snippet of the edited file:\n     1→[\n     2→  {\n     3→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n     4→    \"title\": \"Cross-session messaging\",\n     5→    \"description\": \"Claude Code sessions can now message each other on macOS and Linux, enabling Claude to pass findings and decisions between sessions instead of requiring re-explanation. Introduces ListAgents and SendMessage tools for coordinating work across terminals and worktrees.\",\n     6→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n     7→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\",\n     8→    \"date\": \"2026-08-03\",\n     9→    \"community_feedback\": [\n    10→      {\n    11→        \"quote\": \"It's Claude code talking to another Claude code. With tmux, a memory tree, and handoff files and an orchestrator, agents can talk cross harness.\",\n    12→        \"source\": \"HN\",\n    13→        \"sentiment\": \"neutral\"\n    14→      },\n    15→      {\n    16→        \"quote\": \"Particularly useful when changes in one session impact work in another session.\",\n    17→        \"source\": \"Reddit\",\n    18→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n    19→      }\n    20→    ]\n    21→  },\n    22→  {\n    23→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    24→    \"title\": \"Self-hosted environments in public beta\",\n    25→    \"description\": \"Self-hosted environments run Claude Code cloud sessions on infrastructure your organization operates, now in public beta on Team and Enterprise plans.\",\n    26→    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    27→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\",\n    28→    \"date\": \"2026-08-03\",\n    29→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    30→  },\n    31→  {\n    32→    \"productName\": \"Claude Code\",\n    33→    \"title\": \"Auto mode becomes default\",\n    34→    \"description\": \"Auto mode becomes the default permission mode for new sessions on Pro, Max, and Team plans starting August 14.\",\n    35→    \"updateType\": \"announcement\",\n    36→    \"url\": \"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/whats-new\",\n    37→    \"date\": \"2026-08-03\",\n    38→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    39→  },\n    40→  {\n    41→    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    42→    \"title\": \"Copilot memory and JetBrains features\",\n    43→    \"description\": \"New Copilot memory features and Ollama integration in GitHub Copilot for JetBrains. Copilot Memory helps the assistant become more effective by remembering facts about repositories and personal coding preferences across workflows.\",\n    44→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    45→    \"url\": \"https://docs.github.com/en/copilot/concepts/agents/copilot-memory\",\n    46→    \"date\": \"2026-08-11\",\n    47→    \"community_feedback\": [\n    48→      {\n    49→        \"quote\": \"GitHub Copilot now remembers what it learns across your workflow. Copilot coding agent, CLI, and code review share knowledge automatically.\",\n    50→        \"source\": \"X\",\n    51→        \"sentiment\": \"positive\"\n    52→      },\n    53→      {\n    54→        \"quote\": \"Copilot is worse than useless - consistently ignores highest level instructions\",\n    55→        \"source\": \"GitHub Community\",\n    56→        \"sentiment\": \"negative\"\n    57→      }\n    58→    ]\n    59→  },\n    60→  {\n    61→    \"productName\": \"GitHub Copilot\",\n    62→    \"title\": \"Copilot enterprise management tools\",\n    63→    \"description\": \"New enterprise management tools and administration capabilities for Copilot.\",\n    64→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    65→    \"url\": \"https://github.com/changelog\",\n    66→    \"date\": \"2026-08-11\",\n    67→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    68→  },\n    69→  {\n    70→    \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n    71→    \"title\": \"v0.54.0 stable release - Enhanced Authentication & Security\",\n    72→    \"description\": \"Latest stable release with enhanced authentication and security features, core functionality updates, sandbox improvements, and Vertex updates including Cloud Run webhook ingestion, path and symlink features.\",\n    73→    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    74→    \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\",\n    75→    \"date\": \"2026-08-06\",\n    76→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    77→  },\n    78→  {\n    79→    \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n    80→    \"title\": \"v0.55.0-preview.1 with experimental features\",\n    81→    \"description\": \"Preview release including latest new and experimental features for early adopters.\",\n    82→    \"updateType\": \"release\",\n    83→    \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/\",\n    84→    \"date\": \"2026-08-06\",\n    85→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    86→  },\n    87→  {\n    88→    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    89→    \"title\": \"Google Workspace Plugins\",\n    90→    \"description\": \"Cursor can now read, write, and act across your Google Workspace with plugins for Gmail, Google Drive, and Google Calendar. Enables coding agents to pull context, draft and update files, and manage inbox and calendar without leaving Cursor.\",\n    91→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    92→    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n    93→    \"date\": \"2026-08-03\",\n    94→    \"community_feedback\": []\n    95→  },\n    96→  {\n    97→    \"productName\": \"Cursor\",\n    98→    \"title\": \"Cursor Router with optimization modes\",\n    99→    \"description\": \"Cursor Router is an intelligent model router that analyzes requests and sends them to the right model with Intelligence, Balance, and Cost optimization modes. Frontier models handle demanding work while price-efficient models handle the rest.\",\n   100→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   101→    \"url\": \"https://cursor.com/changelog\",\n   102→    \"date\":